# Catalog refs

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-catalog-ref/SKILL.md`. Product notes: `docs/catalog-refs.md`.

- Mint/validate only through `core/ref` (`Mint`, `Validate`). Do not hand-roll tokens or mint in SQL.
- Machine id stays UUIDv7; `ref` is display/search only — never a foreign key; never recycle.
- Reserved prefixes: `USR`, `SRC`, `ART`, `CIT`, `OBS`. Candidate Nodes use `{PREFIX}-C-{TOKEN}` via a shared helper when implemented — do not invent a parallel generator.
